# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in the key. Vite reads
# `.env.local`, never this file, and bakes what it finds into the build.
#
#   Windows (PowerShell):  copy .env.example .env.local
#   macOS / Linux:         cp .env.example .env.local
#
# The app's own TMDB key, for REC (Discover's recommender). The short "API
# Key" from TMDB's API settings page, not the long "Read Access Token". Set it
# on the machine that builds releases, or REC ships hidden. It ends up in the
# app, never in the repo: keep it in `.env.local` only.
VITE_TMDB_KEY=
